  "details": "Hello, I just had an idea to help with the in game reports concerning avatars that are inappropriate or bad performance:\nWhen using the game's report system for reporting avatars, maybe VR Chat staff could program the report system in the game to copy the part of the latest log file associated with the specific instance number (between enter and exit time) where the report was made and it would make a smaller separate log file that would then be uploaded to VR Chat as part of the report once the player making a report closes the game.",
